 someone? There's no one here!","Turn around and get lost! ...Wait a second."]},{"speaker":76,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,352,352,370,605,569,600,600,468,568,1009,779,342],[181,560]],"speakerSlot":13,"speakerNameZh":"士兵","speakerGlyphs":[93,94],"portraitId":76,"linesZhTw":["　等等，你們通通給我站住！","　』"],"linesZhCn":["　等等，你们通通给我站住！","　』"],"linesEn":["Hold on, every last one of you, freeze!"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,712,672,344,341,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『又怎麼了？』"],"linesZhCn":["『又怎么了？』"],"linesEn":["Now what?"]},{"speaker":76,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,605,343,1012,1013,1014,1015,504,45,358,342],[181,906,388,391,819,605,569,486,1016,619,620,341],[181,1017,61,67,497,132,733,370]],"speakerSlot":13,"speakerNameZh":"士兵","speakerGlyphs":[93,94],"portraitId":76,"linesZhTw":["『你是艾迪‧沙林斯吧！","　自從上次你們一夥搶劫了","　維克勒城之後，"],"linesZhCn":["『你是艾迪‧沙林斯吧！","　自从上次你们一伙抢劫了","　维克勒城之后，"],"linesEn":["You're Eddie Salins, aren't you?!","Ever since your gang raided Wickler City,"]},{"speaker":76,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,568,569,486,861,395,876,605,370,659,346,387,605],[181,669,654,1018,380,721,683,98,367,194,150,341,342],[181,560]],"speakerSlot":13,"speakerNameZh":"士兵","speakerGlyphs":[93,94],"portraitId":76,"linesZhTw":["　我們一直在找你，想不到你","　居然跑去當別人的護衛了！","　』"],"linesZhCn":["　我们一直在找你，想不到你","　居然跑去当别人的护卫了！","　』"],"linesEn":["we've been tracking you down!","Never thought you'd end up playing bodyguard for someone!"]},{"speaker":70,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,584,584,584,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"傭兵","speakerGlyphs":[96,94],"portraitId":70,"linesZhTw":["『…………』"],"linesZhCn":["『…………』"],"linesEn":["............"]},{"speaker":76,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,628,401,464,370,568,658,605,465,343,645,645],[181,146,118,345,1019,370,889,568,569,310,380,370],[181,462,696,716,605,795,796,369,581,585,180,560]],"speakerSlot":13,"speakerNameZh":"士兵","speakerGlyphs":[93,94],"portraitId":76,"linesZhTw":["『所以啊，我看你還是乖乖","　束手就擒，跟我們回去，","　這樣對你比較好。嗯？』"],"linesZhCn":["『所以啊，我看你还是乖乖","　束手就擒，跟我们回去，","　这样对你比较好。嗯？』"],"linesEn":["So give yourself up quietly and come with us.","It'll be much easier on you that way. Understand?"]},{"speaker":10,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,352,486,559,342,194,150,343,666,666,1020,468],[181,568,367,370,605,569,334,1021,806,175,370,614,568],[181,310,380,672,344,376,978,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"瑪琳","speakerGlyphs":[55,56],"portraitId":10,"linesZhTw":["『等一下！護衛是爸爸派給","　我的，你們要抓走他，叫我","　回去怎麼交代？』"],"linesZhCn":["『等一下！护卫是爸爸派给","　我的，你们要抓走他，叫我","　回去怎么交代？』"],"linesEn":["Wait a minute! My father assigned this bodyguard to me!","If you arrest him, how am I supposed to explain this back home?"]},{"speaker":76,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,151,65,346,947,568,569,367,536,342,313,306],[181,271,349,686,367,652,370,345,293,583,693,486,381],[181,1022,1023,342,560]],"speakerSlot":13,"speakerNameZh":"士兵","speakerGlyphs":[93,94],"portraitId":76,"linesZhTw":["『那可不干我們的事！再無","　理取鬧的話，就連妳也一起","　逮捕！』"],"linesZhCn":["『那可不干我们的事！再无","　理取闹的话，就连你也一起","　逮捕！』"],"linesEn":["That's none of our concern!","Keep making a scene and we'll arrest you too!"]},{"speaker":10,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,605,767,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"瑪琳","speakerGlyphs":[55,56],"portraitId":10,"linesZhTw":["『你敢！』"],"linesZhCn":["『你敢！』"],"linesEn":["Don't you dare!"]},{"speaker":77,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,151,533,395,663,411,344,663,180,560]],"speakerSlot":8,"speakerNameZh":"精英戰士","speakerGlyphs":[99,104,105,93],"portraitId":77,"linesZhTw":["『那邊在吵什麼吵？』"],"linesZhCn":["『那边在吵什么吵？』"],"linesEn":["What's all the racket over there?"]},{"speaker":76,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,140,141,370,568,395,462,611,98,331,363,371],[181,486,463,600,1024,961,370,878,175,367,881,98,1025]],"speakerSlot":13,"speakerNameZh":"士兵","speakerGlyphs":[93,94],"portraitId":76,"linesZhTw":["『隊長，我在這群人中發現","　一個通緝犯，但他的主人拒"],"linesZhCn":["『队长，我在这群人中发现","　一个通缉犯，但他的主人拒"],"linesEn":["Captain, I've spotted a wanted fugitive in this group,","but his employer refuses to cooperate."]},{"speaker":76,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,674,725,568,569,1022,1023,175,581,560]],"speakerSlot":13,"speakerNameZh":"士兵","speakerGlyphs":[93,94],"portraitId":76,"linesZhTw":["　絕讓我們逮捕他。』"],"linesZhCn":["　绝让我们逮捕他。』"],"linesEn":["She won't let us take him into custody!"]},{"speaker":77,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,151,345,362,1001,1021,381,579,342],[181,1025,1023,134,1026,135,1027,1028,342,560]],"speakerSlot":8,"speakerNameZh":"精英戰士","speakerGlyphs":[99,104,105,93],"portraitId":77,"linesZhTw":["『那就全部抓起來！","　拒捕者格殺勿論！』"],"linesZhCn":["『那就全部抓起来！","　拒捕者格杀勿论！』"],"linesEn":["Then arrest them all!","Cut down anyone who resists!"]},{"speaker":4,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,658,579,568,569,712,400,316,720,341,370],[181,36,37,370,672,344,673,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"亞雷斯","speakerGlyphs":[43,44,45],"portraitId":4,"linesZhTw":["『看來我們又有麻煩了，","　索爾，怎麼辦？』"],"linesZhCn":["『看来我们又有麻烦了，","　索尔，怎么办？』"],"linesEn":["Looks like we're in trouble again.","Thor, what should we do?"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,462,608,93,94,693,797,908,625,341,342],[181,43,44,45,370,568,569,391,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『這些士兵也太蠻橫了！","　亞雷斯，我們上！』"],"linesZhCn":["『这些士兵也太蛮横了！","　亚雷斯，我们上！』"],"linesEn":["These soldiers are completely out of line!","Ares, let's take them down!"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,462,559,291,659,346,373,634,346,279,1029,342],[181,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『這下子想不打都不行嘍！","　』"],"linesZhCn":["『这下子想不打都不行喽！","　』"],"linesEn":["Guess we don't have a choice but to fight!"]}],[{"speaker":77,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,658,605,569,367,390,118,346,616,343,494,600,98],[181,370,605,569,387,664,343,469,180,560]],"speakerSlot":8,"speakerNameZh":"精英戰士","speakerGlyphs":[99,104,105,93],"portraitId":77,"linesZhTw":["『看你們的身手不像是普通人","　，你們到底是誰？』"],"linesZhCn":["『看你们的身手不像是普通人","　，你们到底是谁？』"],"linesEn":["You're far too skilled to be ordinary folk.","Who are you people?!"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,860,860,534,563,341,370,568,569,865,343,494,600],[181,341,278,279,134,932,341,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『剛剛說過了，我們只是普通","　了旅行者罷了』"],"linesZhCn":["『刚刚说过了，我们只是普通","　了旅行者罢了』"],"linesEn":["Like I said before,","we're just ordinary travelers."]},{"speaker":77,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,346,65,428,342,605,569,674,716,346,343,494,600],[181,367,278,279,134,342,560]],"speakerSlot":8,"speakerNameZh":"精英戰士","speakerGlyphs":[99,104,105,93],"portraitId":77,"linesZhTw":["『不可能！你們絕對不是普通","　的旅行者！』"],"linesZhCn":["『不可能！你们绝对不是普通","　的旅行者！』"],"linesEn":["Nonsense! There is no way you're simple travelers!"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,792,346,792,429,605,341,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『信不信由你了！』"],"linesZhCn":["『信不信由你了！』"],"linesEn":["Believe whatever you like!"]}],[{"speaker":77,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,65,770,342,462,608,98,465,589,820,342],[181,370,702,703,569,313,1030,486,458,571,48,49],[181,125,98,345,579,341,370]],"speakerSlot":8,"speakerNameZh":"精英戰士","speakerGlyphs":[99,104,105,93],"portraitId":77,"linesZhTw":["『可恨！這些人還真強！","　，弟兄們再撐一會兒萊汀","　大人就來了，"],"linesZhCn":["『可恨！这些人还真强！","　，弟兄们再撑一会儿莱汀","　大人就来了，"],"linesEn":["Curse it! These guys are tough!","Hold the line, men! Lord Raiden will be here soon!"]},{"speaker":77,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,313,1030,486,458,571,342,560]],"speakerSlot":8,"speakerNameZh":"精英戰士","speakerGlyphs":[99,104,105,93],"portraitId":77,"linesZhTw":["　再撐一會兒！』"],"linesZhCn":["　再撑一会儿！』"],"linesEn":["Just hold out a little longer!"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,658,175,569,367,696,291,397,398,465,400,604,361],[181,342,125,137,370,199,378,188,140,141,373,784,358],[181,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『看他們的樣子似乎還有援軍","　！大家，先把小隊長打倒吧","　！』"],"linesZhCn":["『看他们的样子似乎还有援军","　！大家，先把小队长打倒吧","　！』"],"linesEn":["It sounds like they have reinforcements on the way!","Everyone, take down their squad leader first!"]}],[{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,188,140,141,370,462,343,672,344,486,310,536,180],[181,560]],"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『小隊長，這是怎麼一回事？","　』"],"linesZhCn":["『小队长，这是怎么一回事？","　』"],"linesEn":["Squad leader, what is the meaning of this?"]},{"speaker":77,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,48,584,48,49,125,98,342],[181,462,486,611,1031,1032,776,654,1025,1023,370],[181,175,569,105,1033,753,995,370]],"speakerSlot":8,"speakerNameZh":"精英戰士","speakerGlyphs":[99,104,105,93],"portraitId":77,"linesZhTw":["『萊…萊汀大人！","　這一群匪徒公然拒捕，","　他們戰技高超，"],"linesZhCn":["『莱…莱汀大人！","　这一群匪徒公然拒捕，","　他们战技高超，"],"linesEn":["L-Lord Raiden!","These bandits are openly resisting arrest!","They're formidable fighters—"]},{"speaker":77,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,568,569,740,1034,999,334,78,559,175,584,560]],"speakerSlot":8,"speakerNameZh":"精英戰士","speakerGlyphs":[99,104,105,93],"portraitId":77,"linesZhTw":["　我們正嘗試要拿下他…』"],"linesZhCn":["　我们正尝试要拿下他…』"],"linesEn":["—we're trying our best to bring them down..."]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,508,579,346,563,343,608,1031,1032,623,339,370],[181,600,600,468,568,1021,381,579,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『原來不過是些匪徒而已，","　通通給我抓起來！』"],"linesZhCn":["『原来不过是些匪徒而已，","　通通给我抓起来！』"],"linesEn":["Nothing more than common ruffians.","Seize every last one of them!"]}],[{"speaker":77,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,605,584,605,569,346,343,486,517,1031,1032,370],[181,605,569,584,387,664,400,893,130,367,180,584,560]],"speakerSlot":8,"speakerNameZh":"精英戰士","speakerGlyphs":[99,104,105,93],"portraitId":77,"linesZhTw":["『你…你們不是一般匪徒，","　你們…到底有何目的？…』"],"linesZhCn":["『你…你们不是一般匪徒，","　你们…到底有何目的？…』"],"linesEn":["Y-You're no ordinary bandits...","Just what... are you after...?"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,462,486,1035,865,343,817,458,623,339,370,568],[181,569,1036,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『這一切只是誤會而已，我","　們─』"],"linesZhCn":["『这一切只是误会而已，我","　们─』"],"linesEn":["This is all just a misunderstanding! We—"]}],[{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,140,584,140,141,342,462,584,462,343,672,344],[181,310,536,180,342,560]],"speakerSlot":33,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『隊…隊長！這…這是怎麼","　回事？！』"],"linesZhCn":["『队…队长！这…这是怎么","　回事？！』"],"linesEn":["C-Captain! What... what happened here?!"]},{"speaker":77,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,1037,166,342,607,380,600,601,533,1038,149,150],[181,140,370,614,175,569,904,1023,462,624,1031,1032,370],[181,568,584,568,339,449,888,213,341,584,584,560]],"speakerSlot":8,"speakerNameZh":"精英戰士","speakerGlyphs":[99,104,105,93],"portraitId":77,"linesZhTw":["『史恩！快去通報邊境守衛","　隊，叫他們追捕這批匪徒，","　我…我已經盡力了……』"],"linesZhCn":["『史恩！快去通报边境守卫","　队，叫他们追捕这批匪徒，","　我…我已经尽力了……』"],"linesEn":["Sean! Hurry and alert the border guards!","Tell them to pursue these bandits... I-I did all I could..."]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,140,584,140,141,342,605,379,255,370,462,272],[181,536,568,486,360,673,387,342,560]],"speakerSlot":33,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『隊…隊長！你放心，這件","　事我一定辦到！』"],"linesZhCn":["『队…队长！你放心，这件","　事我一定办到！』"],"linesEn":["C-Captain! Rest easy, I swear I'll carry out your orders!"]}],[{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,266,464,342,605,569,669,654,435,113,307,745,1020],[181,579,367,1039,1040,140,370,465,378,188,140,141,468],[181,135,341,370,640,300,605,569,346,709,340,362,307]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『天啊！你們居然攻擊王國派","　來的調查隊，還把小隊長給","　殺了，難道你們不怕被全王"],"linesZhCn":["『天啊！你们居然攻击王国派","　来的调查队，还把小队长给","　杀了，难道你们不怕被全王"],"linesEn":["Good grief! You actually attacked a royal investigation unit,","and even killed their squad leader!"]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,745,361,600,1024,338,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["　國軍通緝嗎？』"],"linesZhCn":["　国军通缉吗？』"],"linesEn":["Aren't you afraid of being hunted across the entire kingdom?!"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,462,865,343,486,355,817,458,370,65,343,175,569],[181,346,1041,561,568,569,314,1042,584,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『這只是一場誤會，可是他們","　不肯聽我們解釋……』"],"linesZhCn":["『这只是一场误会，可是他们","　不肯听我们解释……』"],"linesEn":["It was all a misunderstanding,","but they refused to listen to our explanation..."]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,825,370,371,395,534,411,344,634,399,689,643,342],[181,605,569,387,664,343,579,680,411,344,367,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『唉，現在說什麼都沒用啦！","　你們到底是來幹什麼的？』"],"linesZhCn":["『唉，现在说什么都没用啦！","　你们到底是来干什么的？』"],"linesEn":["Sigh... what's done is done.","So what are you folks doing here anyway?"]},{"speaker":10,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,568,569,579,570,876,1000,134,77,78,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"瑪琳","speakerGlyphs":[55,56],"portraitId":10,"linesZhTw":["『我們來此找賢者約拿…』"],"linesZhCn":["『我们来此找贤者约拿…』"],"linesEn":["We came here looking for Sage Jonah..."]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,605,569,343,579,876,77,78,367,180,77,78,732],[181,266,493,345,339,449,353,354,570,114,341,581,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『你們是來找約拿的？約拿兩","　天前就已經離開此地了。』"],"linesZhCn":["『你们是来找约拿的？约拿两","　天前就已经离开此地了。』"],"linesEn":["You're looking for Jonah?","He left here two days ago."]},{"speaker":10,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,629,411,344,180,561,534,175,945,699,579,738,447],[181,353,354,494,80,495,496,367,464,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"瑪琳","speakerGlyphs":[55,56],"portraitId":10,"linesZhTw":["『為什麼？聽說他近年來很少","　離開普里茲港的啊！』"],"linesZhCn":["『为什么？听说他近年来很少","　离开普里兹港的啊！』"],"linesEn":["Why? I heard he rarely left Port Pritz in recent years!"]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,343,399,950,581,346,563,462,463,496,497,811,945],[181,285,613,363,258,346,447,1043,439,1044,536,272,370],[181,289,337,1045,296,387,293,307,745,634,1020,149,402]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『是沒錯。不過這個港城最近","　夜裡發生不少樁失蹤事件，","　狀況嚴重到連王國都派守備"],"linesZhCn":["『是没错。不过这个港城最近","　夜里发生不少桩失踪事件，","　状况严重到连王国都派守备"],"linesEn":["That's true, but lately people have been mysteriously vanishing at night in this port town.","It got so bad that the kingdom dispatched an investigative unit,"]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,140,579,1039,1040,341,370,659,554,605,569,465,346],[181,529,300,358,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["　隊來調查了，想必你們還不","　知道吧！』"],"linesZhCn":["　队来调查了，想必你们还不","　知道吧！』"],"linesEn":["though I take it you didn't know that!"]},{"speaker":4,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,155,346,386,1046,129,486,466,387,717,634,343,93],[181,94,581,560]],"speakerNameZh":"亞雷斯","speakerGlyphs":[43,44,45],"portraitId":4,"linesZhTw":["『怪不得碼頭一帶到處都是士","　兵。』"],"linesZhCn":["『怪不得码头一带到处都是士","　兵。』"],"linesEn":["No wonder soldiers were crawling all over the docks."]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,568,614,827,60,61,62,370,647,77,78,715,343],[181,375,1047,367,726,727,581,493,732,266,175,579,876],[181,568,370,534,175,363,371,486,272,125,1048,1049,370]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『我叫做貝克威，和約拿算是","　滿熟的朋友。前兩天他來找","　我，說他發現一件大陰謀，"],"linesZhCn":["『我叫做贝克威，和约拿算是","　满熟的朋友。前两天他来找","　我，说他发现一件大阴谋，"],"linesEn":["Name's Beckway, an old friend of Jonah's.","Two days ago he came to see me, saying he uncovered a massive conspiracy"]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,647,293,771,579,367,439,1044,536,272,400,762,370],[181,554,538,1050,1051,493,380,1039,1040,581,175,1052,805],[181,568,486,608,536,132,733,345,353,354,341,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["　和連日來的失蹤事件有關，","　必須立刻前去調查。他委託","　我一些事之後就離開了…』"],"linesZhCn":["　和连日来的失踪事件有关，","　必须立刻前去调查。他委托","　我一些事之后就离开了…』"],"linesEn":["tied to these recent disappearances, and had to investigate immediately.","He entrusted me with a few matters and then set off..."]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,589,784,891,370,151,462,1053,346,345,712,257,1018],[181,341,338,180,465,882,570,647,307,745,361,365,341],[181,1054,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『真倒楣，那這趟不就又白跑","　了嗎？還因此和王國軍結了","　怨…』"],"linesZhCn":["『真倒楣，那这趟不就又白跑","　了吗？还因此和王国军结了","　怨…』"],"linesEn":["Just our luck... So this trip was all for nothing?","And on top of that, we've made enemies of the royal army..."]},{"speaker":10,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,605,343,395,222,568,338,180],[181,462,712,346,362,343,568,367,950,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"瑪琳","speakerGlyphs":[55,56],"portraitId":10,"linesZhTw":["『你是在指我嗎？","　這又不全是我的錯！』"],"linesZhCn":["『你是在指我吗？","　这又不全是我的错！』"],"linesEn":["Are you blaming me?!","It's not entirely my fault!"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,583,465,767,534,370,334,346,343,882,629,583,666],[181,666,1020,468,583,367,194,150,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『妳還敢說，要不是因為妳爸","　爸派給妳的護衛…』"],"linesZhCn":["『你还敢说，要不是因为你爸","　爸派给你的护卫…』"],"linesEn":["You have the nerve to say that?","If not for that bodyguard your father assigned you..."]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,369,643,369,643,342,663,630,314,359,346,341,536],[181,816,370,462,696,358,370,77,78,77,341,568,732],[181,266,733,387,43,61,45,307,745,367,307,497,380]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『好啦好啦！吵架解決不了事","　情，這樣吧，約拿約了我兩","　天後到亞克斯王國的王城去"],"linesZhCn":["『好啦好啦！吵架解决不了事","　情，这样吧，约拿约了我两","　天后到亚克斯王国的王城去"],"linesEn":["All right, all right! Bickering won't solve anything.","How about this: Jonah asked me to meet him in two days at the capital of Ax."]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,647,175,772,651,370,843,654,605,569,400,536,876],[181,175,370,345,647,568,486,381,380,369,341,581,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["　和他碰面，既然你們有事找","　他，就和我一起去好了。』"],"linesZhCn":["　和他碰面，既然你们有事找","　他，就和我一起去好了。』"],"linesEn":["Since you need to see him, why not come along with me?"]},{"speaker":1,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,994,180,387,307,497,380,180,151,568,569,346,343],[181,906,1055,74,848,338,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"哈諾","speakerGlyphs":[38,39],"portraitId":1,"linesZhTw":["『嗄？到王城去？那我們不是","　自投羅網嗎？』"],"linesZhCn":["『嗄？到王城去？那我们不是","　自投罗网吗？』"],"linesEn":["Huh? The royal capital?","Wouldn't that be walking straight into the lion's den?"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,462,463,605,569,784,65,401,346,689,1056,255,370],[181,568,653,934,486,360,346,458,400,536,367,581,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『這個你們倒可以不用擔心，","　我保證一定不會有事的。』"],"linesZhCn":["『这个你们倒可以不用担心，","　我保证一定不会有事的。』"],"linesEn":["You don't need to worry about that.","I promise you, everything will be just fine."]},{"speaker":4,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,51,52,43,370,583,629,411,344,767,827,462,719],[181,653,934,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"亞雷斯","speakerGlyphs":[43,44,45],"portraitId":4,"linesZhTw":["『希莉亞，妳為什麼敢做這種","　保證？』"],"linesZhCn":["『希莉亚，你为什么敢做这种","　保证？』"],"linesEn":["Celia, how can you be so sure?"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,462,343,923,547,370,346,831,914,605,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『這是秘密，不告訴你！』"],"linesZhCn":["『这是秘密，不告诉你！』"],"linesEn":["That's a secret! I'm not telling!"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,369,370,843,654,697,570,370,568,569,345,803,402],[181,391,794,358,342,60,61,62,199,258,370,404,672],[181,696,470,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『好，既然如此，我們就準備","　上路吧！貝克威先生，您怎","　樣呢？』"],"linesZhCn":["『好，既然如此，我们就准备","　上路吧！贝克威先生，您怎","　样呢？』"],"linesEn":["Well then, let's get ready to move out!","Mr. Beckway, what about you?"]},{"speaker":13,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,199,647,568,310,497,765,486,1053,370,352,568,706],[181,707,486,559,461,86,370,667,458,571,345,65,401],[181,1057,1058,341,581,806,358,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"貝克威","speakerGlyphs":[60,61,62],"portraitId":13,"linesZhTw":["『先和我回城裏一趟，等我收","　拾一下東西，待會兒就可以","　啟程了。走吧！』"],"linesZhCn":["『先和我回城里一趟，等我收","　拾一下东西，待会儿就可以","　启程了。走吧！』"],"linesEn":["Come back into town with me first so I can pack my gear.","We can head out right after. Let's go!"]}],[{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,808,809,464,810,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『奈野啊捏？』"],"linesZhCn":["『奈野啊捏？』"],"linesEn":["How did things turn out like this...?"]}]]}